    "## 4. Model 1 — LSTM\n",
    "\n",
    "**Architecture.** A word-level vocabulary is built from the training prompts and options only.\n",
    "For each of the 5 candidates we build a single sequence\n",
    "`question tokens + [SEP] + option tokens`, embed it with a trainable embedding layer, encode it\n",
    "with a **bidirectional LSTM**, pool the encoder outputs (masked mean + max pooling concatenated\n",
    "with the final hidden state), and pass the pooled vector through a small MLP to get **one scalar\n",
    "score**. The same encoder/scorer weights are shared across all 5 candidates of a question\n",
    "(\"class-independent\" scoring) — the model produces `[score_A, ..., score_E]` and is trained with\n",
    "cross-entropy over the 5 options."
