    "## 5. Model 2 — BiGRU with Attention Pooling\n",
    "\n",
    "Second from-scratch model, and deliberately built differently from Model 1: a **bidirectional GRU** (different gating than LSTM, no separate cell state) with its own embedding table, followed by an **attention-pooling layer** that learns to weigh each token instead of the mean+max+final-hidden pooling used for the LSTM. Scorer head is also a single smaller layer. Trained and early-stopped independently."
   ]
